---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="How It Works | Smokeless Heat" description="Learn how Varmebaronen Vedolux wood gasification boilers work and what makes them different from other gasification boilers.">
  <Header />

  <main class="pt-24">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-charcoal text-cream">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <p class="text-ember text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-4">Varmebaronen Vedolux</p>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-5xl md:text-6xl">How It Works</h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Intro -->
    <section class="py-16 bg-cream">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
        <img src="/images/introducingVarm.png" alt="Introducing Varmebaronen" class="w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 border border-wood/20" />
        <p class="text-lg text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed">
          Varmebaronen provides gasification firewood boiler models, including boilers with no electric natural draft, simple controlled induced draft and induced draft computerized Lambda controlled boilers.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- What makes it different -->
    <section class="py-16 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-darkwood mb-10">What makes a Varmebaronen Vedolux different from most other gasification boilers?</h2>

        <div class="mb-12">
          <img src="/images/good_design-1.png" alt="Good design" class="w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto border border-wood/20" />
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-10">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-darkwood mb-3">Unique Curved Tube Exchanger</h3>
            <p class="text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed">
              Each Varmebaronen Vedolux boiler model shares a <strong>unique curved tube exchanger design</strong>, enabling easy cleaning of the exchanger from an upper front door. That space also doubles as a <strong>very effective smoke bypass</strong> that captures the smoke when opening the loading door. Boiler brands that have exchangers in the rear under a bolt-on cover can take hours to clean if the turbulators need to be removed.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-darkwood mb-3">Induced Draft Fan</h3>
            <p class="text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed">
              Vedolux boilers use an <strong>induced draft fan</strong> which keeps the boiler firebox in a negative pressure state, avoiding smoke from escaping from around the doors. Induced draft fans are generally better at keeping smoke out of your boiler room as opposed to brands operating with push fans.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-darkwood mb-3">Built-in Airflow Pathways</h3>
            <p class="text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed">
              The primary and secondary air airflow pathways are built into the body to allow <strong>perfect burns</strong> without the operator needing to make complicated adjustments. Because the airflow has been so well designed, the boiler will typically be operating <strong>smoke free within 5 minutes</strong> of lighting without the need to develop an extensive coal bed. Many brands must develop a coal bed and take 3 times as long before they burn smoke free.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div>
            <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-darkwood mb-3">Lower Mass, Easily Replaced Wear Parts</h3>
            <p class="text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed">
              Vedolux boilers have a <strong>lower mass</strong> than most other gasifier brands of their respective size but they are built heavy where warranted. The very high wear areas are designed as consumable items and are <strong>easily replaced</strong>. The lower overall mass and expansive exchanger area enables all the induced draft Vedolux models to be generating usable water into the storage tank within 20 minutes from firing—often about the time other brands are just beginning to gasify. Many higher mass boilers take more than twice as long to have usable hot water and many have hard-to-replace ceramic castings.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12">
          <img src="/images/Vedolux.jpg" alt="Vedolux 3D boiler cutaway" class="w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto border border-wood/20" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Boiler and Accumulator System -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-cream">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl text-darkwood mb-8">Boiler and Accumulator Tank System</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          The Vedolux boiler system is designed to burn wood in a safe, efficient and eco-friendly manner. The accumulator tanks are the key to achieving efficiency and convenience by acting as “batteries,” storing the heat for later use.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-charcoal/80 leading-relaxed">
          If you were leaving to go on vacation, electric heating elements in an accumulation tank could assist in your absence. Another option is to install the Viking pellet boiler burner, which can be done with a few minutes of installation. If you already have a fossil fuel boiler, it usually can be used as the backup system.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Downloads -->
    <section class="py-16 bg-white">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-darkwood mb-8">Download PDF Files</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-lg">
          <li>
            <a href="/images/Varmebaronen_brochure.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-ember hover:underline">
              4-page general brochure
            </a>
            <span class="text-charcoal/70"> — featuring an informative overview of the product line.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/images/wood_fired_heating_2014_en.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-ember hover:underline">
              24-page catalog
            </a>
            <span class="text-charcoal/70"> — featuring Natural draft and Induced draft fan wood boilers.</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/images/vedolux_lambda_brochure-4.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-ember hover:underline">
              20-page catalog
            </a>
            <span class="text-charcoal/70"> — with the Lambda controlled wood boilers.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Video at the bottom -->
    <section class="py-16 bg-charcoal text-cream">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl mb-6 text-center">Watch Video Featuring Varmebaronen Wood Boilers</h2>
        <div class="aspect-video w-full overflow-hidden border border-wood/30">
          <iframe
            src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/gKZJFOsDLmU"
            title="Varmebaronen Wood Boilers"
            class="w-full h-full"
            frameborder="0"
            allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
            allowfullscreen
          ></iframe>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
